 "supersedes_v2": "v2 IS THE APPROVED DRAW AND IS UNCHANGED. v3 is v2 plus `instance_sha256` per chosen instance, stamped so the run guard compares against a value fixed at approval time rather than one re-derived by the current generator (RR, L17). The rule, draw seed and pool are identical, and main() asserts the draw reproduces v2 exactly.",
